Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Permissions|

Set Up: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Tear Down: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|

Scenario: Add Folder Site Role Default Permission
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When Permissions set Up Site Role CP
		|page|Public Pages|
		|pageName|Web Content Page|
		|portletName|Web Content|
		|roleTitle|Roles Siterole Name|
		|roleType|Site|
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And Permissions define Permission CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_WEB_CONTENT_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ACCESS_IN_SITE_ADMINISTRATION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Access in Site Administration|
		|roleTitle|Roles Siterole Name|
		|roleType|Site|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Web Content Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'Button#PLUS'

Scenario: Add Folder Site Role Define Permission
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|CPRolesCPWebcontent#AddFolderSiteRoleDefinePermission|
	And Permissions set Up Site Role CP
		|page|Public Pages|
		|pageName|Web Content Page|
		|portletName|Web Content|
		|roleTitle|Roles Siterole Name|
		|roleType|Site|
		|siteName|Site Name|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	And Permissions define Permission CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_WEB_CONTENT_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ACCESS_IN_SITE_ADMINISTRATION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Access in Site Administration|
		|roleTitle|Roles Siterole Name|
		|roleType|Site|
	And Permissions define Permission CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_WEB_CONTENT_RESOURCE_PERMISSIONS_WEB_CONTENT_ADD_FOLDER_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Add Folder|
		|roleTitle|Roles Siterole Name|
		|roleType|Site|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContentFolder add CP
		|folderDescription|WC Folder Description|
		|folderName|WC Folder Name|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
	And Permissions remove Permission CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_PAGES_SITE_PAGES_RESOURCE_PERMISSIONS_SITE_GO_TO_SITE_ADMINISTRATION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Go to Site Administration|
		|roleTitle|Roles Siterole Name|
		|roleType|Site|
	And Permissions remove Permission CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_WEB_CONTENT_RESOURCE_PERMISSIONS_WEB_CONTENT_ADD_FOLDER_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Add Folder|
		|roleTitle|Roles Siterole Name|
		|roleType|Site|
	And User logout And Login PG
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Web Content Page|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	Then AssertElementNotPresent at locator 'Button#PLUS'

