Scenario: View Web Content Portlet Reg Role
Priority: 4
	Given Permissions set Up Reg Role Login User CP
		|portletName|Web Content|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userFirstName|userfn|
		|userLastName|userln|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
		|userScreenName|usersn|
	When Navigator open URL
	And Permissions define Permission Login User CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_WEB_CONTENT_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ACCESS_IN_SITE_ADMINISTRATION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Access in Site Administration|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And WebContent view No Permission CP
	And Permissions remove Permission Login User CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_PAGES_SITE_PAGES_RESOURCE_PERMISSIONS_SITE_GO_TO_SITE_ADMINISTRATION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Go to Site Administration|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|test@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|Test Test|
	Then Permissions remove Permission Login User CP
		|permissionDefinitionKey|SITE_ADMIN_CONTENT_WEB_CONTENT_GENERAL_PERMISSIONS_ACCESS_IN_SITE_ADMINISTRATION_CHECKBOX|
		|permissionDefinitionValue|Access in Site Administration|
		|roleTitle|Regrole Name|
		|userLoginEmailAddress|userea@liferay.com|
		|userLoginFullName|userfn userln|

